  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If you have a world using the Combat System, that is setup so players can be killed, and thus enter a rag doll...  if any player is using a generic avatar (instead of mecanim) such as the common way My Little Pony or other type avatars are often done due to their non-humanoid rigs... as soon as that player is killed, the rag doll system breaks their avatar. Meaning that all sounds and voices from them from that point on comes from where they died, and no one can see them anymore. This issue persists until they join another world.",
